ngineers and conduct code and framework reviews.&#xa0;  &#xa0;Define strategies for performance, load, scalability, and reliability testing.&#xa0;  &#xa0;Track automation coverage, defect escape rate, test stability, and release readiness.&#xa0;     Required Qualifications&#xa0;    5-10&#xa0;years of software testing and quality engineering experience.&#xa0;  5+ years of hands-on test automation development experience.&#xa0;  Strong programming skills in Java, C#, Python, or JavaScript/TypeScript.&#xa0;  Hands-on experience building and maintaining automated test suites using modern automation tools such as Playwright, Selenium, Cypress, Postman/Newman, REST Assured, and API testing frameworks, with demonstrated expertise in designing scalable and maintainable test automation solutions.&#xa0;  Strong understanding of software architecture and distributed systems.&#xa0;  Experience with CI/CD practices and Agile development.&#xa0;    Preferred Qualifications&#xa0;    Experience with AWS, Azure, or Google Cloud.&#xa0;  Experience with Docker and Kubernetes.&#xa0;  Experience with performance testing tools.&#xa0;  Experience in SaaS, cloud-native, or distributed systems environments.&#xa0;  Experience with accessibility and security testing.&#xa0;    Success Indicators&#xa0;    Improve automation coverage across critical workflows.&#xa0;  Reduce flaky test rates.&#xa0;  Shorten test execution times.&#xa0;  Increase confidence through automated quality gates.&#xa0;  Mentor engineers and improve quality culture.&#xa0;      Renesas is an embedded semiconductor solution provider driven by its Purpose ‘ To Make Our Lives Easier .’ As the industry’s leading expert in embedded processing with unmatched quality and system-level know-how, we have evolved to provide scalable and comprehensive semiconductor solutions for automotive, industrial, infrastructure, and IoT industries based on the broadest product portfolio, including High Performance Computing, Embedded Processing, Analog &amp; Connectivity, and Power. 
