th a strong sense of ownership and business awareness.  Excellent communication and collaboration skills across cross-functional teams  Ability to manage multiple priorities and deliver under tight deadlines in a fast-paced, results-driven environment.  Solid understanding of semiconductor industry dynamics and sales processes is a plus.      Renesas is an embedded semiconductor solution provider driven by its Purpose ‘ To Make Our Lives Easier .’ As the industry’s leading expert in embedded processing with unmatched quality and system-level know-how, we have evolved to provide scalable and comprehensive semiconductor solutions for automotive, industrial, infrastructure, and IoT industries based on the broadest product portfolio, including High Performance Computing, Embedded Processing, Analog &amp; Connectivity, and Power. 
