ds-on experience with EDA tools, chip design flows, or semiconductor development lifecycle  Prior Hands-on experience with AI/ML frameworks (e.g., TensorFlow, PyTorch, or similar) is a plus  Prior experience building AI-driven solutions for Design optimization and Automation/ productivity improvement is preferred  Familiarity with Cloud platforms and scalable compute infrastructure and Data-driven decision systems is preferred      Renesas is an embedded semiconductor solution provider driven by its Purpose ‘ To Make Our Lives Easier .’ As the industry’s leading expert in embedded processing with unmatched quality and system-level know-how, we have evolved to provide scalable and comprehensive semiconductor solutions for automotive, industrial, infrastructure, and IoT industries based on the broadest product portfolio, including High Performance Computing, Embedded Processing, Analog &amp; Connectivity, and Power. 
