nted, and able to manage multiple priorities.  Comfortable working in a global, multicultural environment.  Written and verbal English is mandatory.  Flexible to undertake international travel at short notice.  Self-motivated and business service minded.  Excellent interpersonal, organizational and communications skills  5+ years of experience&#xa0;      Renesas is an embedded semiconductor solution provider driven by its Purpose ‘ To Make Our Lives Easier .’ As the industry’s leading expert in embedded processing with unmatched quality and system-level know-how, we have evolved to provide scalable and comprehensive semiconductor solutions for automotive, industrial, infrastructure, and IoT industries based on the broadest product portfolio, including High Performance Computing, Embedded Processing, Analog &amp; Connectivity, and Power. 
