&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;support residents with their activities of daily living including eating, dressing, hygiene and grooming as per residents&rsquo; individual plans of care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide Resident Care and Services&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;aid residents with respect to their communication and connections by encouraging them to wear individual sensory aids such as glasses, hearing aides, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
