&lt;li&gt;Ensure residents have constant and easy access to mobility or assistive devices such as canes, walkers, call bells, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support Resident Comfort &amp; Well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
