&lt;p&gt;Clinical Management&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&bull; Provide clinical leadership and guidance to nursing staff to ensure the delivery of safe, effective and person-centered care to residents&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&bull; Collaborate with healthcare professionals to develop and implement care plans that address the individual needs and preferences of residents&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
