&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Assistant Director of Wellness&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Aspira Stonebridge Crossing Retirement Living - 102 Wellman Crescent, Saskatoon, SK S7T 0G3&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary: $55,451 - $69,314&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;This posting is for an existing vacancy.&lt;/p&gt;
