&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with the Director of Wellness to schedule and adjust staffing levels to ensure consistency with the residence&rsquo;s occupancy levels, the acuity of the residents and the services being offered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide oversight and management of the Continence Care Program; completing assessments, orders, sizing, and service transitions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overseeing and supervising the medication administration program including administering of medications, completing audits, monitor control, training of new team members and safekeeping of drugs and narcotics.&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coverage for Director of Wellness Absences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage Wellness Team Onboarding and education requirements&lt;/li&gt;
