-Developing SOWs for the procurement of equipment and services;

-Developing functional and performance specifications for equipment and services;

-Developing technical evaluation plans, including bid matrices, procedures and reports;

-Conducting technical bid evaluations for the procurement of equipment and services;

-Tailoring military or commercial standards, specifications or practices for incorporation into system specifications

